category: Web
requires: cygwin libintl8 libmaxminddb0 libncursesw10 libssl3
sdesc: "Real-time web log analyzer"
ldesc: "GoAccess is an open source real-time web log analyzer and interactive viewer
that runs in a terminal in *nix systems. It provides fast and valuable HTTP
statistics for system administrators that require a visual server report on
the fly."

